      "content": "It makes perfect sense that you want to alleviate their suffering, but the thought of ending your own life is a desperate attempt to solve a problem that isn't truly yours to solve. Your parents' exhaustion is a reflection of circumstances, not solely your worth, and you deserve to be free from this self-imposed guilt. If you are truly feeling this deep despair, please reach out to someone who can help you navigate these overwhelming feelings right now.",
